14 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TurboSquad is still in early and active development. If you want to follow the adventure, add the game to your wishlist and join our discord server! We are working hard to add more content: new maps, new weapons, new characters, new features! Don\u2019t miss that out!</p>",
